01:03:03.220 --> 01:03:06.940
And I think we have a right
and an obligation to do that.

01:03:06.940 --> 01:03:07.950
- Most people, I think,

01:03:07.950 --> 01:03:10.100
when you present to them the opportunity

01:03:10.100 --> 01:03:13.160
to live longer and healthier,

01:03:13.160 --> 01:03:16.440
they say, "Oh yeah, I
would like that future."

01:03:16.440 --> 01:03:19.870
Right now, the things
that we have talked about

01:03:19.870 --> 01:03:22.900
that make that kind of a future easier,

01:03:22.900 --> 01:03:25.800
reprogramming, really, really effective,

01:03:25.800 --> 01:03:27.433
drugs and supplements,

01:03:28.596 --> 01:03:30.580
they're getting there,
but they're not there.

01:03:30.580 --> 01:03:34.210
Which means if somebody wants
to partake in this future

01:03:34.210 --> 01:03:37.210
and they're of any age right now,

01:03:37.210 --> 01:03:38.700
they actually have to put in the work.

01:03:38.700 --> 01:03:41.151
It's not just going to be handed to them

01:03:41.151 --> 01:03:42.430
in the next few years.

01:03:42.430 --> 01:03:44.990
- No, it's not just
simple as take two pills

01:03:44.990 --> 01:03:46.440
and call me in the morning kind of stuff

01:03:46.440 --> 01:03:48.980
or call me in the next
decade, it is hard work.

01:03:48.980 --> 01:03:50.550
You don't get anything for free.

01:03:50.550 --> 01:03:53.860
You can't just yet pop a pill
and go back 20, 30 years,

01:03:53.860 --> 01:03:56.250
though maybe in the future we will.

01:03:56.250 --> 01:03:59.310
But for now, the best
recipe for long life,

01:03:59.310 --> 01:04:01.930
greater health and ensure
that you make it past 80, 90,

01:04:01.930 --> 01:04:05.000
maybe even into your 100s,
is to do the right things.

01:04:05.000 --> 01:04:07.350
There's eat the right way, okay?

01:04:07.350 --> 01:04:09.520
Eat the right of kind of diets.

01:04:09.520 --> 01:04:12.710
Don't eat as often, have
some period of fasting.

01:04:12.710 --> 01:04:14.870
Get some type of exercise.

01:04:14.870 --> 01:04:18.040
Even better, do multiple
different types of exercise.

01:04:18.040 --> 01:04:20.360
Stress your body out a little
bit, give it some hormesis,

01:04:20.360 --> 01:04:22.030
these are adversity mimetics,

01:04:22.030 --> 01:04:25.220
so a bit of cold, a bit of
heat, those kind of things.

01:04:25.220 --> 01:04:27.030
The other thing we talked
about is some supplements

01:04:27.030 --> 01:04:29.330
and these new technologies
we've talked about today,

01:04:29.330 --> 01:04:31.030
the monitoring and other things,

01:04:31.030 --> 01:04:33.250
that will actually
allow us to live longer.

01:04:33.250 --> 01:04:35.350
