I care about living longer?"

01:04:35.350 --> 01:04:36.900
Well, absolutely, you should.

01:04:36.900 --> 01:04:37.733
Why?

01:04:37.733 --> 01:04:38.930
Because the longer you live,

01:04:38.930 --> 01:04:40.550
the longer you will live.

01:04:40.550 --> 01:04:44.030
Right now, if we live an extra year,

01:04:44.030 --> 01:04:45.380
